	(text "LiPo (protected cell). Pin 1 = -\n(GND), pin 2 = + (BATT):\nTinyCircuits' own wiring (their\ndatasheet fig. 4); meter the leads\nbefore plugging in (BRING-UP-TESTS 2)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 507.21 319.75 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "06300981-675f-499c-ad59-a0be57dfc4ee")
	)
	(text "UPDI path: SBU (both pins) - R72 1 k - UPDI (the MCU's UPDI pin). D50 clamps UPDI to +3V3."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 365.252 459.486 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "19454dfb-0fbd-4d81-9fd9-c209e22f2539")
	)
	(text "MCU decoupling: 100 nF per supply pin + 10 uF bulk on\nVBAT"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 359.3 175.07 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1c71efd9-d16c-4005-99b0-7d7c5bd21046")
	)
	(text "LED MATRIX: 12 columns (sectors) x 11 rows (slot 0 = hour, 1-5 = minutes, 6-10 = seconds). Anodes -> COLn\n(sources), cathodes -> ROWn (sinks)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40.8 47.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 3 3)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "25c320f2-432c-4799-bcca-138c63009682")
	)
	(text "POWER: TI BQ25570 solar harvester (80% MPPT) charges the LiPo; its built-in 3.3 V buck makes the +3V3 rail"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 496.12 118.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 3 3)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6abe14bc-a199-4bd2-b5d6-7a6e6c5ef966")
	)
	(text "LIS2DW12 accelerometer on I2C (SDA = PF2, SCL = PF3, TWI1) from the 3.3 V\nrail. CS high = I2C mode; SDO/SA0 low = address 0x18; pin 7 RES to\nGND (DS11811 Table 1). FIRMWARE: set PINnCTRL.INLVL = TTL on\nIMU_INT's pin (the sensor's high is only about 3.1 V and the MCU\nruns at up to 4.2 V)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 509.5 54.17 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6b239eab-7d2d-4e99-abd7-8f00b0c13dcb")
	)
	(text "Second pouch in parallel\n(J1B): same polarity rule as\nJ1."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 573.21 319.75 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "761af95a-9340-4da2-91c9-5c4ecad47547")
	)
	(text "Series resistor per column: 220 ohm from led_resistor.py (peak LED current 1.6-4.8 mA over 3.3-4.12 V; worst case <= 5 mA). Confirm brightness\non the bench (PRE-ORDER-CHECKLIST C2)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.64 286.98 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.5 2.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7dca76c8-d96c-41a2-8e78-40bbf28a33e5")
	)
	(text "Piezo BZ1: PB4 / PB5 drive it in antiphase\n(TCA1 split mode, PB5 inverted via\nPORTB.PIN5CTRL.INVEN)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 359.24 315.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "85de8002-9716-45ef-864c-e3747b63d70e")
	)
	(text "Three resistor dividers program the BQ25570\n(datasheet 7.3.3, 7.3.4, 7.3.6): R50/R51 stop\ncharging at 4.12 V; R52-R54 set the BAT_OK flag\n(falls at 3.31 V, rises at 3.78 V); R55/R56 set the\n3.31 V output rail."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 674.878 235.458 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9a7e63ea-1d8b-420a-beff-870f2e0dddb2")
	)
	(text "Cosmetic dummy resistors R57-R67 (not connected): they\nkeep the board layout symmetric around the 12 / 3 / 6 /\n9 o'clock parts."
