				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a93b0904-3f97-4962-9225-7a5f1188b0eb")
	)
	(text "USB-C CHARGING AND UPDI PROGRAMMING (replaces the 1.27 mm pogo pads). The receptacle sits on the back at the rim (3 o'clock). VBUS -> U5 (BQ21040) ->\nBATT; the two SBU pins carry UPDI (1 k in series, BAT54WS clamp to +3V3); USB data pins are not used."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 360 366.41 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
