	(text "32.768 kHz crystal on PF0/PF1 (XTAL32K1/2). Seiko SC-32S wants CL = 12.5 pF:\n(18 pF + 5 pF pin capacitance)/2 + ~1 pF stray = 12.5 pF (AVR128DB\ndatasheet Table 39-10). Use C0G caps."
